{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_111_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春，季孫行父如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"二、三月，宋司馬華孫來盟。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"司馬，官也。其以官稱，無君之辭也。來盟者何？前定也。不言及者，以國與之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"三、夏，曹伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"四、齊人歸公孫敖之喪。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"五、六月，辛丑，朔，日有食之。鼓，用牲於社。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"六、單伯至自齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"大夫執則致，致則名。此其不名何也？天子之命大夫也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"七、晉郤缺帥師伐蔡。戊申，入蔡。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"八、秋，齊人侵我西鄙。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"其曰鄙，遠之也。其遠之何也？不以難介我國也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"九、季孫行父如晉。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"十、冬，十有一月，諸侯盟於扈。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"十一、十有二月，齊人來歸子叔姬。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"其曰子叔姬，貴之也。其言來歸何也？父母之於子，雖有罪，猶欲其免也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_111_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_111","textTraditional":"十二、齊侯侵我西鄙，遂伐曹，入其郛。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}